---
// The real numbers from the internship, and the stack. Nothing else is claimed.
---

<div class="fdf sc-wide">
  <div class="fdf-fig">
    <p class="fdf-v">~80%</p>
    <p class="fdf-c">Less manual fault-triage time. The first pass a person used to do by hand, reading logs and finding the procedure, now arrives as a report.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="fdf-fig">
    <p class="fdf-v">93%</p>
    <p class="fdf-c">Top-3 retrieval accuracy: how often the right maintenance guidance is among the three sections retrieved for a fault.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="fdf-fig fdf-stack">
    <p class="fdf-k">Built with</p>
    <p>Python and FastAPI, PostgreSQL, ROS, LangChain and LangGraph, Chroma.</p>
    <p class="fdf-k">Shipped</p>
    <p>Deployed as an internal tool during the internship, May to August 2026. The code is private.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .fdf { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: var(--s6); }
  .fdf-fig { border-top: 2px solid var(--sc-ink); padding-top: var(--s3); }
  .fdf-v { font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 4.75rem); line-height: 1; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.03em; font-variant-numeric: lining-nums; }
  .fdf-c { margin-top: var(--s3); font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--sc-ink-2); }
  .fdf-stack { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--sc-ink-2); }
  .fdf-k { font-style: italic; color: var(--sc-ink-3); font-size: 14px; }
  .fdf-k:not(:first-child) { margin-top: var(--s3); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .fdf { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } .fdf-stack { grid-column: 1 / -1; } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .fdf { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--s5); } }
</style>
